<title>SOUTH AFRICA: RUGBY UNION-CURRIE CUP QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-CURRIE CUP QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of quarter-final</p>
<p>matches in the Currie Cup on Saturday:</p>
<p>In Durban: Natal 51 Griqualand West 3 (halftime 32-3)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Natal - Tries: Thierry Lacroix, Andre Joubert (2), James</p>
<p>Small, Jeremy Thompson, Joss Joubert, Robert du Preez.</p>
<p>Conversions: Lacroix, Henry Honiball. Penalties: Honiball,</p>
<p>Lacroix (2). Drop goal: Andre Joubert</p>
<p>Griqualand West - Penalty: Franco Smith.</p>
<p>In Johannesburg: Transvaal 56 Western Province 22 (16-14)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Transvaal - Tries: Jannie van der Walt (4), Joe Gillingham,</p>
<p>Hennie le Roux, Bennie Nortje. Conversions: Gavin Lawless (6).</p>
<p>Penalties: Lawless (3).</p>
<p>Western Province - Tries: Justin Swart, Pieter Rossouw,</p>
<p>Joggie Viljoen. Conversions: Louis Koen (2). Penalties: Koen.</p>
<p>Semifinal line-up:</p>
<p>Free State v Natal (in Durban)</p>
<p>Transvaal  v Northern Transvaal (in Pretoria)</p>
<p>Matches to be played on October 19.</p>
</text>
